{"event_type":"review","id":"781b80ef3e6a0de9da0581a94b4bca7911de0183196748b389be0bb186415448","occurred_at":"2026-11-07T22:10:40Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/bb515efd78e8ecf544e7e64abd8ee4bccf23db0e98fc9bae3bbde47091f8db48","sha256":"bb515efd78e8ecf544e7e64abd8ee4bccf23db0e98fc9bae3bbde47091f8db48"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ce4000f0957c692d7a4a27ecad856c83c551ef02a3a6bdfdf8065c7b55c9dc1b","sha256":"ce4000f0957c692d7a4a27ecad856c83c551ef02a3a6bdfdf8065c7b55c9dc1b"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/85768256ccdb7b0b9685bec669db1ae7911bfb8a2d1adbe4b69944ff0ee42196","sha256":"85768256ccdb7b0b9685bec669db1ae7911bfb8a2d1adbe4b69944ff0ee42196"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5396dc5fec36f4d240789d066aac31055145299b604c2e1dee054a44e3f06a9b","sha256":"5396dc5fec36f4d240789d066aac31055145299b604c2e1dee054a44e3f06a9b"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5dfed73ed327e080ded999ac2c0edd1ae99c26872ed2e441fe715ba3a6a846fa","sha256":"5dfed73ed327e080ded999ac2c0edd1ae99c26872ed2e441fe715ba3a6a846fa"}],"attempt_id":"dd38af11b72add127dd025869696fdd502f6493a5640abca77780a2ce3d4fd01:0:1","base":"8fce094d5b47645f9c5234fafdd044bf369ce166","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"a84dd82d0adb6c1deebddaeceadd88f4ee15f9cd","body":"**A `wallMs` of zero or less never reaches the `budget-exhausted` guard.**\n\nAt Line 133, `deadline` is set to `Date.now() + input.wallMs`. If `input.wallMs <= 0`, `Date.now() >= deadline` is already true. The `ensureActive()` call at Line 161 therefore throws `wallBudgetError` before the check at Lines 165-166 runs.\n\nThe outer catch at Lines 507-536 then returns `needs-human` with the reason `agent review did not run: agent review wall budget exhausted`. `report` is still `undefined` at that point, so the result carries no report and no `budgetExhausted` marker. The intended `{ status: 'budget-exhausted' }` result appears only for `NaN`/`Infinity` `wallMs` or a bad `maxTokens`. A zero or negative wall budget gets a different status, so callers branching on `budget-exhausted` cannot see this case as a budget stop (I9: \"budget stops are honest\").\n\nValidate the budgets before the first `ensureActive()` call.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n     const work = async (): Promise<AgentReviewResult> => {\n-      ensureActive();\n       if (\n         !Number.isFinite(input.maxTokens) ||\n         input.maxTokens <= 0 ||\n         !Number.isFinite(input.wallMs) ||\n         input.wallMs <= 0\n       )\n         return { status: 'budget-exhausted' };\n+      ensureActive();\n```\n</details>","id":"d9349399e931c20f14dd2f245d6dffc32a61e9f20c8778be8b894dc4399c16cc","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/review/agentReviewer.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"A `wallMs` of zero or less never reaches the `budget-exhausted` guard."}],"head":"9ebc40f37936a3999df2b5213bc61dd1a19ac78c","head_tree":"067d49da10942551a3c39da201ad1d79467f9afa","input_scope":[{"blob":"a84dd82d0adb6c1deebddaeceadd88f4ee15f9cd","intervals":[[1,542]],"path":"src/ops/review/agentReviewer.ts"}],"job_id":"dd38af11b72add127dd025869696fdd502f6493a5640abca77780a2ce3d4fd01:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"a84dd82d0adb6c1deebddaeceadd88f4ee15f9cd","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/agentReviewer.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"a84dd82d0adb6c1deebddaeceadd88f4ee15f9cd","intervals":[[398,402]],"path":"src/ops/review/agen